{"start":"t:body","attrs":{}}
{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n84.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"149","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/1","n":"1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Halleluyah. Sing unto the Lord a new song, His fame is in the gathering of the pious. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/2","n":"2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Israel rejoices in its Maker, the sons of Zion exult in their King. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/3","n":"3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Let them praise His Name with dancing, with timbrel and harp let them play to Him. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/4","n":"4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"For the Lord favours His people, He adorns the humble with victory. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The pious revel in honour, they exult upon their couches. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/6","n":"6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Exaltations of God are in their throat and a two-edged sword in their hand, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/7","n":"7"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"so as to carry out vengeance among the nations, chastisements among the peoples, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/8","n":"8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"to bind their kings in fetters and their notables in chains of iron, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"to execute on them the judgment that is written. He is an adornment to all His pious ones. Halleluyah. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
